      "message": "Do you have a use for this ? It seems a bit error-prone to me ; if may be better to forbid this.\n\nIf it\u0027s for your test in SM05, you can write\n\n    private val mState5 \u003d spy(object : TestState(MSG_5) {})\n\nThat makes anonymous objects and is terse enough.",
