        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-14T02:23:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ohh, my example above is wrong. Actually the state is in the same hierarchy so that Unavailable just have one instance.\n\nI think it is fine to forbid this but I don\u0027t find an easy way to do this. We need a way to force all States to implement equals()/hashCode() or implement a identifiable equals()/hashCode() and let all State extend it.",
      "parentUuid": "92714aba_5c94468f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 39,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 40,
        "endChar": 15
      },
      "revId": "4d794b4a130aeb52e39bdf239efb278814b508f4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
